uce this matrix to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -4 & -3 \\\\ 2 & k & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -4 & -3 \\\\ 0 & k+8 & 10\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-4y &=-3 \\\\ (k+8)y &=10.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe system is inconsistent if it has no solutions. For the system to have no solutions, one of the equations above must be false.\n\nIf $k=-8,$ then the second equation is $0=10,$ which is false, and the system will have no solution.\n\nTherefore, our system is inconsistent when $k=-8.$" 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673957 1080 "k=-11" 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673957 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673957 1083 #uuid "6aee5c58-e2b4-5f01-b8e0-82c1d4d6fae3" 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673958 1080 "k=-3" 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673958 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673958 1083 #uuid "78bfd2d2-c99e-5e73-89ba-284716020227" 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673959 1080 "k=-7" 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673959 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673959 1083 #uuid "7a99227a-c092-5ab1-ac9c-f9a74758da2a" 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673960 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673947 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673960 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673948 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673960 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673952 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673960 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673962 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673960 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673968 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673960 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538890 17592186045443 true] [17592186673960 1077 "selection" 